## Set up

Payments › Packages and settings › Connect Stripe opens Stripe's own sign-up. You're the seller: your
own VAT, receipts and refunds, all in Stripe. Stripe's card fees are yours; LogIt takes nothing.

## When a payment fails

Stripe retries the card and emails the client a link to update it. You choose what happens to coaching
meanwhile, for everyone or per client.

